          "after": [
            "| Models recognize shared dependencies and other centers of significance | [Concern formation](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-concern-theory/THEORY.md) and [revisable-concern settlement](REVISABLE-CONCERN-SETTLEMENT.md) construct learning and widening under declared premises. [Recipient correction](RECIPIENT-CORRECTION.md) now carries actual formed coupling states through paid target evidence and context-preserving action correction, including a private-resource-neutral recipient benefit. [Paid identification](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-concern-theory/RECIPIENT-IDENTIFICATION-INTEGRATION.md) adds sound positive qualification under a stable-target outage law, retaining unresolved and unaffordable histories. The [actual recipient archive](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-concern-theory/RECIPIENT-RECORDING-INTEGRATION.md) now carries acquired events into formed four-bit frames and a paid partial factual cache, with unknown outcomes and failed recording retained. | Derive the origin and revision of their positive anchors and transfer architecture; an operational prediction target alone does not supply its evaluative use. Explain and justify recognition beyond private usefulness. Explain formation and retention of faithful recipient evidence despite that private-resource tie; consume the actual paid contextual certificates in a compatible reason mechanism and succession, preserving their correlated orientation predicates, unknown status, remaining resources and separate relevance/root premises. |"
